cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SXM Viewer in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SXM Viewer"
type: software
abstract: >-
  SXM Viewer is a Python/PyQt5 desktop application for browsing, analysing and
  visualising scanning probe microscopy (SPM) data. It reads Anfatec/Omicron
  data natively and Nanonis .sxm/.dat/.3ds files through a conversion adapter,
  and provides image analysis (profiles, angles, cropping, filtering),
  spectroscopy and grid-spectroscopy visualisation and fitting (including
  KPFM), overlays, publication figure composition and PDF folder reports.
